OL,6,FA teenager has been stabbed and a man
OL,7,Fhas been arrested following an incident
OL,8,Fin Worcester.
OL,10,FWest Mercia Police were called to
OL,11,FNorthfield Street at about 11:40 BST on
OL,12,FMonday.
OL,14,FThe 16-year-old victim was found with
OL,15,Finjuries that are not thought to be
OL,16,Flife-threatening or life changing.
OL,18,FA 21-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion grievous bodily harm and
OL,20,Fremains in police custody.
